  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.GoldskyOASIS v2.0.3\n\nGoldsky Real-Time Subgraph Indexing Provider Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- docs: add README.md for 57 providers + bump submodule pointers (87b2b85)\n- feat: add 9 new providers — 202 total (+restaking, +sequencing, +edge storage, +identity) (b9c9d9d)\n- feat: fully implement all 12 Network providers with real APIs, fix interfaces (37d88e8)\n- feat: implement real API/SDK for all new providers (21 providers across 6 categories) (0d09c71)\n- fix: resolve all build errors for new providers (stubs, usings, enum values) (a33a25e)\n- fix(network providers): replace 173 fake-success methods with explicit errors (2e9b330)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Network/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.GoldskyOASIS",
